    "detailed_description": "<strong>Enter the heart-pounding world of Pitch Race</strong>, where the thrill of 3D multiplayer car racing meets musical prowess. This innovative game seamlessly incorporates a musical instrument as the primary controller, transforming every note played into fuel for victory. As players master their chosen instrument, they propel their cars across interconnected networks, with the intensity of their music dictating the speed of their journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this exhilarating adventure, each level offers unique challenges:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Level 1</strong> and beyond introduce separate notes for turning left/right and driving, requiring precision and skill to navigate the twists and turns of the track.<br></li><li><strong>Level 2</strong> and beyond raise the stakes by dynamically changing the notes for turning and driving throughout the game, keeping players on their toes and their fingers agile.</li></ul>Pitch Race isn't just a game it's the ultimate long tone workout for musicians, blending adrenaline-pumping action with the discipline of musical mastery. Are you ready to rev up your engine and hit all the right notes on the road to victory?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Enter the heart-pounding world of Pitch Race</strong>, where the thrill of 3D multiplayer car racing meets musical prowess. This innovative game seamlessly incorporates a musical instrument as the primary controller, transforming every note played into fuel for victory. As players master their chosen instrument, they propel their cars across interconnected networks, with the intensity of their music dictating the speed of their journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this exhilarating adventure, each level offers unique challenges:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Level 1</strong> and beyond introduce separate notes for turning left/right and driving, requiring precision and skill to navigate the twists and turns of the track.<br></li><li><strong>Level 2</strong> and beyond raise the stakes by dynamically changing the notes for turning and driving throughout the game, keeping players on their toes and their fingers agile.</li></ul>Pitch Race isn't just a game it's the ultimate long tone workout for musicians, blending adrenaline-pumping action with the discipline of musical mastery. Are you ready to rev up your engine and hit all the right notes on the road to victory?",
